This time, Dragon Quest Heroes: The World Tree's Woe and the Blight Below will showcase all the developers' accumulated ideas and finally present the public with a true action game featuring a wide variety of skills. Furthermore, this time, the game will feature a much more diverse enemy lineup, hundreds of weapons, and dozens of diverse skills, including dozens of colorful characters.

